ranted to the European Union (Withdrawal) Act in 2018."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1613, "end": 1784, "text": "The UK Parliament's use of dynamic utilization of condensing metadata facilitated the swift passage of the legislation, ensuring a timely exit from the European Union (4)."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1785, "end": 1795, "text": "References"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1797, "end": 1810, "text": "(1) Smith, J."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1811, "end": 1818, "text": "(2012)."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1819, "end": 1922, "text": "\"The Role of Technology in Royal Assent: A Case Study of the Constitutional Reform and Governance Act.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1923, "end": 1970, "text": "Journal of Legislative Studies, 18(2), 123-145."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1971, "end": 2002, "text": "(2) Johnson, K., & Thompson, R."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2003, "end": 2010, "text": "(2015)."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2011, "end": 2108, "text": "\"Dynamic Utilization of Condensing Metadata in Royal Assent: A Study of Efficiency and Accuracy.\""}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2109, "end": 2147, "text": "Cambridge Law Journal, 74(2), 251-275."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2148, "end": 2172, "text": "(3) Scottish Government."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2173, "end": 2180, "text": "(2014)."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2181, "end": 2249, "text": "\"Scottish Independence Referendum Act: Review and Approval Process.\""}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2250, "end": 2281, "text": "Edinburgh: Scottish Government."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc